#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:3
msgid ""
"For 3FS introduction and **deployment**, please refer to [the official "
"documentation](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/3FS).   **⚠️ Recommended "
"3FS source code compilation and installation path: /usr/local**"
