#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:6
msgid ""
"**Ds3fs Store** is chained together with **Cache Store** through "
"**PipelineStore** to form a data transfer pipeline."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:8
msgid "In this chained pipeline:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:9
msgid "**Cache Store** handles data transfer between the **Device and Host**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:10
msgid ""
"Once the data flows from the Device to the Host, **Ds3fs Store** is "
"responsible for transferring the data between the **Host and 3FS**."
msgstr ""

