#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:16
msgid ""
"This document uses **two nodes** to deploy 3FS service. Specifically, "
"**MGMTD, META, and Storage1 are deployed on the same node, while Storage2"
" is deployed on another node**. Each Storage node aggregates **two NVME "
"disks**."
msgstr ""

