#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:69
msgid "Configuration for Prefix Caching"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:71
msgid ""
"Modify the UCM configuration file to specify which UCM connector to use "
"and where KV blocks should be stored. You may directly edit the example "
"file at:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:74
msgid "`unified-cache-management/examples/ucm_config_example.yaml`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:76
msgid "A minimal configuration looks like this:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:86
msgid "Required Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:88
msgid "**ucm_connector_name**: Specifies `UcmPipelineStore` as the UCM connector."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:91
msgid ""
"**store_pipeline: \"Cache|Ds3fs\"** Specifies a pipeline built by "
"**chaining the Cache Store and the Ds3fs Store**. In this chained "
"pipeline, the Cache Store handles data transfer between the **Device and "
"Host**, and once the data reaches the Host, the Ds3fs Store transfers it "
"between the **Host and 3FS**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:96
msgid ""
"The pipeline must be registered in advance in `unified-cache-"
"management/ucm/store/pipeline/connector.py` under `PIPELINE_REGISTRY`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:99
msgid "Currently, **only this Store chain is supported**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:102
msgid ""
"**storage_backends**: 3FS storage path used for storing KV blocks.   **⚠️"
" Replace `\"/mount/3fs\"` with your actual 3FS mount path.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:106
msgid "Optional Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:108
msgid "**io_direct** (optional, default: `true`): Whether to enable direct I/O."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:111
msgid ""
"**stream_number** *(optional, default: 32)* Number of concurrent streams "
"used for data transfer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:114
msgid ""
"**waiting_queue_depth** *(optional, default: 1024)* Depth of the waiting "
"queue for transfer tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:117
msgid ""
"**running_queue_depth** *(optional, default: 32768)* Depth of the running"
" queue for transfer tasks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:120
msgid ""
"**timeout_ms** *(optional, default: 30000)* Timeout in milliseconds for "
"external interfaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/user-guide/prefix-cache/ds3fs_store.md:123
msgid ""
"**buffer_size** *(optional, default: 64GB)* Amount of dram pinned memory "
"used by a single worker process."
msgstr ""

